                "loc": "MAL.1.2+MAL.1.3+MAL.1.4+MAL.1.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 1.2–5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has prepared his sword in heaven, and now it will strike Edom, those people whom he has condemned to destruction. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His sword will be covered with their blood and fat, like the blood and fat of lambs and goats that are sacrificed. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will offer this sacrifice in the city of Bozrah; he will make this a great slaughter in the land of Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people will fall like wild oxen and young bulls, and the earth will be red with blood and covered with fat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the time when the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will rescue Zion and take vengeance on her enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rivers of Edom will turn into tar, and the soil will turn into sulphur. The whole country will burn like tar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rev 14.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It will burn day and night, and smoke will rise from it for ever. The land will lie waste age after age, and no one will ever travel through it again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owls and ravens will take over the land. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " will make it a barren waste again, as it was before the creation. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There will be no king to rule the country, and the leaders will all be gone.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verse 12 in Hebrew begins with a word, the meaning of which is unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thorns and thistles will grow up in all the palaces and walled towns, and jackals and owls will live in them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wild animals will roam there, and demons will call to each other. The night monster",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "night monster",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": A female demon, believed to live in desolate places.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " will come there looking for a place to rest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owls will build their nests, lay eggs, hatch their young, and care for them there. Vultures will gather there, one after another.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Search in the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s book of living creatures and read what it says. Not one of these creatures will be missing, and not one will be without its mate. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded it to be so; he himself will bring them together. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " who will divide the land among them and give each of them a share. They will live in the land age after age, and it will belong to them for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
